  "name": "Crab and Shrimp Louis",
  "subtitle": "A chilled seafood salad with crisp vegetables and tangy dressing",
  "description": "Arrange crab, shrimp, vegetables, and sliced eggs over lettuce, then finish with a zesty chile dressing and fresh garnishes.",
